    email: thanosgoulas@outlook.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5478-8117"
abstract: >
  A standalone desktop application for designing ceramic resin
  and paste formulations for additive manufacturing. Supports
  forward formulation (amounts to composition) and inverse
  solving (target solids loading to amounts), with a built-in
  editable materials database, PDF export, and blend support.
keywords:
  - 3D printing
  - additive manufacturing
  - ceramic
  - formulation
  - DLP
  - vat photopolymerisation
  - resin
  - paste
  - inverse solver
